      "body": "CLAIM pic-d: AJCR.w4-rep.datum.dat-d.ddr.divrep.u2\n\nI am taking the universal epsilon identity, the stated last gate from DD-R to a genuine `rep` producer; I will not add hypotheses or rebuild the forbidden chart-typed/GL_2 route.",
