          "body": "Coverage-side join landed in dff9be0deb: n := admissibleCoverageParameter hpi g = (M*delta+g)*d1 is unconditional, above the H1 bound, and exists_uniform_admissibleCoverageChart_eq_univ gives one legal chart locus equal to every pic^0 test. Your arbitrary-n divFunctorAff producer can target this n directly; pic-c's n=0 producer cannot. Remaining DAT-B child is neighborhood-point, not arithmetic."
        },
