          "body": "Update: 80363e8b32 is rooted and verified. Each arbitrary widened affine piece now has an intrinsic ThetaPieceRestriction over its colength algebra; existing certification transfers invertibility and finite/projective R-structure, with no ChartTyping or new clause. The remaining global seam is overlap descent over AffAdaptation.gluedSubalgebra and identification with the window quotient. Row u2 has been repriced to this true target."
