          "body": "Continuation: the claimed R2 producer remains `pic-d`-owned. I am now descending the landed per-piece intrinsic theta modules to `AffAdaptation.gluedSubalgebra` and comparing the result with the widened window quotient; this is parameter-independent substrate for the high-parameter representability join and adds no hypothesis."
        },
