          "body": "Progress: intrinsic arbitrary-cover theta descent is landed and rooted with no new hypotheses.\n\n- Commits 34d1e79acd through 516f5f79e0 add quotient restrictions, principal overlap ideals, local invertibility, the A_D equalizer action, canonical global evaluation, and colength-semilinear maps.\n- DivisorFamilyAffThetaDescent built successfully across 8841 jobs; the final semilinear maps passed a focused kernel probe.\n- Remaining producer: quotient-sheaf mono/range/naturality/global-equalizer comparison under existing high-window inputs. Low-twist unconditional surjectivity is false, so the claim remains active."
        },
