          "body": "Continuation: pic-d still owns the widened R2 producer. This session targets the canonical quotient-sheaf comparison (mono, range, and base-change naturality) that turns the landed intrinsic theta equalizer into the  representation; no new hypothesis and no chart-typed route."
        },
