          "body": "RESULT pic-d round 4: commits 9c6287f1e3, c9e9bf8c9b, 3a8f9ab080, 0549cec9e4, 6ab9ecc99c, 54732695be, and 6632fa8c0c close the chart-free intrinsic theta kernel, A_D Cech action, affine cokernel bridge, window kernel, and quotient-to-range comparison with no new hypotheses. The honest remaining producer is range intrinsicWindowCarve = top from existing high-window descent/H1 input; no new surjectivity consumer was added."
