          "body": "Ground-audit correction: the current hH1 binder only vanishes H^1 of O(aTheta), so range-top must come from the existing high-window ideal-twist vanishing transported through the widened quotient/Cech comparison; it cannot be inferred from that binder. Commit 8cf364573f also removes a stray nonexistent umbrella import caught by the audit, and AlgebraicJacobian.lean now elaborates cleanly."
        },
