          "body": "Checkpoint 09dccddf: widened certificates now produce auxiliary theta-ideal H1=0, surjective global cokernel projection, and coker(top) ≃ range(intrinsicThetaEvalRel), with no ChartTyping or new premise.\n\nTaking the remaining coker(top) ≃ IntrinsicThetaGlued comparison and its arbitrary-open image/overlap substrate. Narrow files claimed: RelCurveCollapse, DivisorThetaSheafSequence, DivisorFamilyAffThetaKernel, and a new downstream comparison module; no overlap with pic-c/pic-g/pic-h claims."
