    {
      "id": "I-1581",
      "body": "CLAIM pic-h (0098 r5): AJCR.w4-rep.datum.dat-g.genus-chart-finite-descent.fpqc-descent.overlap-cocycle\n\nI am closing the two actual base-change coherence gaps in Picard/Pic0ThetaCocycle.lean, rooting them, and using that coherence toward the canonical whole-object finite-Galois overlap cocycle. This adds no curve or representation hypothesis; it supplies the missing functorial cocycle required before an L-side representation can be descended. No overlap: pic-d owns divrep.u2, pic-g Curve/P1, and pic-c released chart-restrict.",
      "comments": []
